&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;9227465&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;14930352&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We temporarily enable the ability to attach programs, as root. Then, we grab the process id and pass it to the reptyr tool, which does a great job in moving our old process back to this new shell. We can now detach from this screen session by typing &lt;em&gt;Ctrl + Shift + D&lt;/em&gt; and confirming the session is saved:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;shellscript&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; screen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-1 z-d-4&quot;&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-1 z-d-4&quot;&gt;ls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;There&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; screen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; on:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;	10822.fibo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;	(Detached&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; Socket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; /run/screens/S-alexpnt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Later, when can reattach to the screen:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;shellscript&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; screen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-1 z-d-4&quot;&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-1 z-d-4&quot;&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; fibo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;24157817&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;39088169&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;63245986&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
